# Alhaitham Furina Ororon Dori. ~21s Rot. Long field time Alhaitham with High energy restoration. Ororon doesn't trigger Scroll in the first rotation.

# Team
alhaitham char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
alhaitham add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
alhaitham add set="mh" count=4;
alhaitham add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 dendro%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
alhaitham add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.0992 er=0.1102 em=158.56 cr=0.2648 cd=0.662; # HoD
